Z||000000||Jeff's '86 1/2 GT||04-19-2000||05:16 AM||||<BR>I am thinking about getting a Chip for my owner to put in me.  My questions is which one will work the best?  An ADS, or a Hypertech? And then should I get a street chip or a strip chip?  What gains am I looking at? Thanks, for the info.  And if you see my owner tell him "I am still in the garage, and was never here." He hates it when I get on without him knowing it.||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||04-20-2000||08:37 AM||||cute...    I had an ADS Strip, with a 160* thermostat. I noticed a HP and Torque increase off the baseline and through the curve, but no noteable increase at peak. so you'll be faster and stronger to any speed but don't expect a miracle. Appreciate never expect. You'll drink more gas cause your owner will be driving you much harder playing with the new found go. but once he gets used to it he'll notice your gas mileage return to almost normal. Oh even though the package says you won't pass emissions.. you'll be just fine. ||||reg||1
